  "description": "One day, her husband asks if his cousin can stay over for a while. But something feels off. The way they act, the stolen glances… is she just being paranoid? Or is there something much worse going on right under her roof? A web of lies, betrayal, and deception begins to unravel.                                    \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/8538), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12382687), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5700000304), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000069285), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250362) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \nEnglish ([Toomics](https://toomics.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/8538), HoneyToon), [Spanish (LA)](https://toomics.com/mx/webtoon/episode/toon/8538), [Italian](https://toomics.com/it/webtoon/episode/toon/8538), [Spanish (ES)](https://toomics.com/es/webtoon/episode/toon/8538), [B.Portuguese](https://toomics.com/por/webtoon/episode/toon/8538), [French](https://toomics.com/fr/webtoon/episode/toon/8538), [German](https://toomics.com/de/webtoon/episode/toon/8538), [Japanese](https://toomics.com/ja/webtoon/episode/toon/8538)",
